OL,3,ASix shot dead by gunmen at church
OL,4,Afuneral in Jordan, officials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FSecurity forces have been deployed to
OL,7,Fthe area after the "heinous" attack,
OL,8,Fgovernment spokesman Mohammad al-Momani
OL,9,Fsaid.
